    "text": "A team's delegation map for its Claude workflow is six months old. Since then, two reviewers changed roles, volume doubled, and a shared procedure changed. Several steps still require collaboration, but nobody has checked who reviewed last week's outputs. Which TWO actions would restore the map as a useful operating control?",
